  "answer_text": "Good news \u2014 **Miraculous Ladybug Season 2, Episode 12 has already aired!** It is not an upcoming episode.\n\nThe episode number depends on the airing order used, but here are the details:\n\n- **\"Gorizilla\"** is listed as Season 2, Episode 12 in some orderings (e.g., on Rotten Tomatoes and English broadcast order). It aired on **May 13, 2018**, and features Adrien's bodyguard getting akumatized into Gorizilla, who is endowed with extraordinary strength and an acute sense of smell to track Adrien all through Paris.\n\n- **\"Sapotis\"** is listed as Season 2, Episode 12 on the official Miraculous Ladybug website. In this episode, as Marinette and Alya are having a sleepover, Alya's little sisters Etta and Ella get akumatized by Hawk Moth into Sapotis \u2014 small, out-of-control monsters who multiply upon eating. Overwhelmed, Ladybug calls on Alya and entrusts her with the Fox Miraculous, turning her into Rena Rouge, the fox superheroine.\n\nBoth episodes are already available to watch! You can find them on streaming platforms like **Disney+** or the official Miraculous Ladybug website. \ud83d\ude0a",
